    - id: operations
      markdown: "# Operations & observability\n\nPlan for the day after launch.\n\n## SLIs SLOs and SLA targets\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.1 -->\nSLI: share of API requests returning < 500 within 1 s. SLO: 99.5% over 28 days. No external SLA in release 1.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Logs metrics and traces\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.2 -->\nJSON logs with request IDs and redacted cookies; RED metrics per route; OpenTelemetry traces via OTLP; logs kept 30 days.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Alerts and on-call ownership\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.3 -->\nPage on-call when the 1-hour SLO burn rate exceeds 14×; business-hours rotation of 3 engineers; every alert links to a runbook.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Incident response and escalation\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.4 -->\nSEV1: all customers affected — incident commander paged, status page within 15 minutes, blameless review within 5 business days.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Operational runbooks\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.5 -->\nRotate the email API key; restore from backup; drain and restart the worker; revoke a compromised session.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Backup and restore verification\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.6 -->\nNightly backups plus point-in-time recovery; encrypted off-site copies; quarterly restore test into staging.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Disaster recovery RPO and RTO\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.7 -->\nRegion outage: RPO 15 minutes, RTO 4 hours using restored backups in a secondary region; tested yearly.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Operating cost and capacity review\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.8 -->\nMonthly cost review with Finance; alert at 80% of the hosting budget; quarterly capacity forecast.\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Around-the-clock on-call\n\n<!-- sdd:answer operations.11 -->\nNo\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n"
      diagram: "flowchart TD\n  alert[Alert fires] --> ack[On-call acknowledges]\n  ack --> sev{Severity?}\n  sev -- SEV1 --> incident[Declare incident and page commander]\n  sev -- SEV3 --> ticket[Create ticket]\n  incident --> mitigate[Mitigate]\n  mitigate --> review[Blameless review]"
      answers:
        operations.1:
          value: "SLI: share of API requests returning < 500 within 1 s. SLO: 99.5% over 28 days. No external SLA in release 1."
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.2:
          value: JSON logs with request IDs and redacted cookies; RED metrics per route; OpenTelemetry traces via OTLP; logs kept 30 days.
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.3:
          value: Page on-call when the 1-hour SLO burn rate exceeds 14×; business-hours rotation of 3 engineers; every alert links to a runbook.
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.4:
          value: "SEV1: all customers affected — incident commander paged, status page within 15 minutes, blameless review within 5 business days."
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.5:
          value: Rotate the email API key; restore from backup; drain and restart the worker; revoke a compromised session.
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.6:
          value: Nightly backups plus point-in-time recovery; encrypted off-site copies; quarterly restore test into staging.
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.7:
          value: "Region outage: RPO 15 minutes, RTO 4 hours using restored backups in a secondary region; tested yearly."
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.8:
          value: Monthly cost review with Finance; alert at 80% of the hosting budget; quarterly capacity forecast.
          state: answered
          reason: ""
        operations.11:
          value: no
          state: answered
          reason: ""
      status: draft
